  "description": "Protect and enhance your 2023-2026 Kia Sportage (Non-Hybrid) with OEDRO floor liners, designed for a perfect fit and unbeatable performance. Made from durable, high-quality materials, these liners provide comprehensive protection against dirt, spills, and daily wear and tear. Their non-shedding design ensures they won’t trap debris or accumulate stains, keeping your car’s interior spotless. Cleaning is effortless—simply wipe or rinse them with soap and water for a like-new look every time. OEDRO floor liners combine durability, convenience, and style to deliver reliable, long-lasting protection for your Kia Sportage.\nFeatures\nDurability: OEDRO floor mats are crafted from strong, high-quality rubber, offering unmatched longevity compared to standard mats. Their flexibility and heavy-duty material can endure constant wear, providing reliable protection against daily use.\nSleek Design: Elevate your car’s interior with OEDRO all-weather floor liners. Their modern, stylish design adds a touch of elegance and enhances your vehicle’s overall appearance.\nSuperior Interior Protection: OEDRO floor mats provide unparalleled coverage, keeping your car’s carpet clean, dry, and shielded from dirt, spills, and debris. Enjoy peace of mind with all-around protection.\nEasy to Clean: Maintenance is effortless! Simply rinse off spills or debris with soap and water. The mats dry quickly and leave no lingering odors, keeping your car fresh and hygienic.\nTraps Dirt and Moisture: Featuring a waterproof surface, these mats effectively trap spills, dust, sand, and dry particles, ensuring a mess-free and pristine interior.\n2-years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2023-2026 Kia Sportage\nNot for Hybrid Models",
